{"id":"en_the-don-s-daughter-is-off-limit","title":"The Don's Daughter Is Off-Limit","titleEn":"The Don's Daughter Is Off-Limit","description":"For eighteen years, Arthur kept his criminal history buried, devoting himself to raising his daughter in peace. That quiet life shatters once she becomes the target of bullying and threats, forcing him to expose the man he used to be. The underworld bows, and adversaries from his past are shaken. In the aftermath, he closes accounts that have waited nearly two decades, discovers the son he never knew he had, brings his family back together, and finally gives his wife the wedding she has been denied all these years.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-dons-daughter-is-off-limit/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-dons-daughter-is-off-limit/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Amnesia","Comeback","Family Love","Feel-Good","Finding Relatives","Hidden Identity"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsa2q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-don-s-daughter-is-off-limit_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsa2q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-don-s-daughter-is-off-limit_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsa2q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-don-s-daughter-is-off-limit_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsa2q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-don-s-daughter-is-off-limit_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumb